"Protected values become placeholders like {PERSON_1}. Exact and compact, but an external AI sometimes rewrites the braces, and a rewritten placeholder cannot be restored." = "受保護的值會變成 {PERSON_1} 這類預留位置。格式精確且簡潔，但外部 AI 有時會改寫大括號；一旦預留位置被改寫，就無法還原。";
"Protected values become natural stand-in names like Company A or 甲公司. AI tools treat them as names and leave them alone, so documents come back restorable even after heavy editing." = "受保護的值會變成「Company A」或「甲公司」這類自然的替代名稱。AI 工具會將它們視為名稱並保留原樣，因此即使經過大量編輯，文件仍可還原。";
"Protected values are masked in place, like 张*明 or 138****5678, the form courts and regulators expect. Best for sending to a person; if two values share one mask, that mask is reported instead of guessed at restore." = "受保護的值會以原位置星號遮蔽，例如張*明或 138****5678，這是法院和監管機關通常要求的格式。最適合傳送給他人；若兩個值共用同一遮罩，還原時會回報該遮罩，而不會逕行猜測。";
"Bring documents in" = "匯入文件";
"Drop Word, PDF, or text files (or a .zip). The app finds names, companies, dates, amounts, emails, phones, and IDs, and you review what it will protect." = "拖入 Word、PDF 或文字檔案（或 .zip）。App 會找出姓名、公司、日期、金額、電子郵件、電話和身分證件編號，再由您檢閱要保護的內容。";
"Hand the safe copy to any AI" = "將安全副本交給任何 AI";
"Export for AI saves a redacted Markdown file. Upload it to ChatGPT, Claude, or any tool, with your instructions." = "「匯出供 AI 使用」會儲存一個遮蔽後的 Markdown 檔案。連同您的指示上傳到 ChatGPT、Claude 或任何工具中。";
"Bring the answer back" = "還原回答";
"Restore takes the file the AI gave back and puts the real values in, flagging anything it cannot match with certainty. Save the final document in its original format." = "「還原」會讀取 AI 交回的檔案並填回實際值，凡無法確定對應的內容都會標示出來。請以原始格式儲存最終文件。";
"LDA processes document contents and stores the encrypted mapping on this Mac. If you ask it to download a detection model, it connects to the model host. Copying or exporting a document lets you send it to a service you choose, so review that service's privacy settings first." = "LDA 會處理文件內容，並將加密對應表儲存在此 Mac 上。如果您要求下載偵測模型，LDA 會連線至模型主機。複製或匯出文件後，您可以將它傳送至自行選擇的服務，因此請先檢查該服務的隱私權設定。";
"Anything you choose to keep visible stays visible in the exported document." = "您選擇保留可見的任何內容，都會在匯出的文件中保持可見。";
