"Finds names, companies, and addresses on every kind of contract we tested, and it is the only setting that runs on a 16 GB Mac. On two full agreements, one English and one Chinese, it found 35 of the 36 names, companies, and addresses that had to be caught. It is the least precise of the three: about one flag in five is something you will look at and dismiss, so reviewing takes longer than waiting does." = "在我們測試的各類合約中，它都能找出姓名、公司與地址，而且這是唯一能在配備 16 GB 記憶體的 Mac 上執行的設定。在兩份完整協議中，一份為英文，另一份為中文，它找出了必須辨識的 36 個姓名、公司與地址中的 35 個。它是三個設定中精確度最低的：大約每五個標記中就有一個會在檢閱後被排除，因此檢閱所花的時間比等待結果更長。";
"The best all round choice when your Mac has the memory. It also found 35 of 36, and it is by far the tidiest to review: only about one flag in fifteen is something you will dismiss. It reports what it finds in exactly the wording of your document, so nothing is lost between finding a name and redacting it. The one it missed was a Chinese bank branch name, so on Chinese documents prefer Most thorough when the document matters." = "如果您的 Mac 有足夠的記憶體，這是整體表現最佳的選擇。它同樣找出了 36 個中的 35 個，而且檢閱起來最省心：大約每十五個標記中只有一個會被排除。它會完全依照文件中的原文呈現辨識結果，因此從發現姓名到將其隱去之間不會遺失任何資訊。唯一漏掉的是一家中國銀行分行的名稱。因此，對於重要的中文文件，請優先選擇最徹底。";
"The only setting that missed nothing. On the same two agreements it found all 36 names, companies, and addresses, including the ones Quick and Balanced each missed. You pay for that twice: it takes about twice as long as Balanced, and it flags more that you will dismiss, roughly one in eight. Choose it for the document you cannot afford to get wrong." = "這是唯一沒有漏掉任何內容的設定。在同樣的兩份協議中，它找出了全部 36 個姓名、公司與地址，包括快速和平衡各自漏掉的內容。代價有兩方面：所需時間約為平衡的兩倍，而且會標記更多最終被您排除的內容，大約每八個中有一個。對於絕不能出錯的文件，請選擇此設定。";
