"Detection models process document text on this Mac. When you press Download, LDA connects to the configured model host to fetch the selected model file. Offline mode below tells LDA to refuse network requests, but it is an app setting rather than a firewall." = "偵測模型會在這台 Mac 上處理文件文字。點選下載時，LDA 會連線到已設定的模型主機以取得所選模型檔案。下方的離線模式會讓 LDA 拒絕網路請求，但它是 App 內設定，不是防火牆。";
"Refuse all network requests, including model downloads. This is a setting inside LDA, not a firewall." = "拒絕所有網路請求，包括模型下載。這是 LDA 內部的設定，不是防火牆。";
"Quick is the smallest download and works on every Mac LDA supports. With 24 GB of memory or more, Balanced finds the same amount and leaves you far less to dismiss. Most thorough is the only one that missed nothing in our testing." = "快速是下載量最小的選項，並可在 LDA 支援的每台 Mac 上執行。如果記憶體為 24 GB 或以上，平衡能找到同樣多的內容，同時需要排除的項目少得多。最徹底是我們的測試中唯一沒有遺漏的設定。";
"A downloaded copy of %@ is also on this Mac. It is not needed because %@ is built into the app." = "這台 Mac 上也有一份已下載的 %@ 副本。%@ 已內建於 App，因此無需保留該副本。";
"%@ of %@" = "%@ / %@";
"Each round-trip records what was protected and what was restored. Records never contain the sensitive values themselves and stay encrypted on this Mac." = "每次往返都會記錄哪些內容被保護與還原。記錄絕不包含敏感值本身，並且一直加密儲存在這台 Mac 上。";
"Higher settings find more names, companies, and addresses, and take longer. Detection uses the selected model on this Mac." = "更高的設定能找到更多姓名、公司與地址，但所需時間也更長。偵測使用這台 Mac 上選定的模型。";
"It reports a portion of the names and addresses it finds in a slightly different form from your document, so those are never redacted and never reach your review list. The Quick model does not have this problem and runs at the same speed." = "它會以與文件稍有不同的形式回傳部分姓名與地址，因此這些內容不會被隱去，也不會進入檢閱清單。「快速」模型沒有這個問題，而且執行速度相同。";
"LDA cannot estimate speed or memory for a model it does not know. It overrides the setting above." = "LDA 無法估算未知模型的速度或記憶體需求。它會取代上方設定。";
"The file holds this matter's documents, your review decisions, and the values needed to restore them. Choose a passphrase for it." = "該檔案包含此案件的文件、您的檢閱決定以及還原內容所需的值。請為其設定密碼短語。";
