"If you downloaded the model on another Mac, add the file here. LDA checks it against the checksum published with this version and copies it into its own folder, so it works exactly like a download." = "如果你在另一台 Mac 上下載了模型，可以在此新增該檔案。LDA 會用本版本隨附的雜湊值進行核對，並把檔案複製到自己的目錄中，使用效果與直接下載完全相同。";
"Add Model File…" = "新增模型檔案…";
"This works with offline mode on. Adding a file makes no network request." = "開啟離線模式後此功能仍可使用。新增檔案不會發出任何網路請求。";
"Offline copy of the Quick model:" = "快速模型的離線副本：";
"Copy Link" = "複製連結";
"Copied" = "已複製";
"The release page lists two parts, a checksum file, and the commands to join and check them. Add the joined file here." = "發布頁面列出了兩個分割檔、一個雜湊值檔案，以及用於合併和驗證的指令。請在此新增合併後的檔案。";
"Checking there is room for the file" = "正在檢查磁碟空間是否足夠";
"Added and verified." = "已新增並通過驗證。";
"Adding the file was cancelled. Nothing was installed." = "已取消新增檔案，未安裝任何內容。";
"Use your own model, unchecked" = "使用你自己的模型（不驗證）";
"Any local GGUF file. LDA does not check this file and does not copy it: it stays where it is and is used as it is. LDA cannot tell you how well it will work, how long it will take, or how much memory it needs." = "任意本機 GGUF 檔案。LDA 不會驗證該檔案，也不會複製它：檔案留在原處，按原樣使用。LDA 無法告訴你它的效果、耗時或記憶體用量。";
"Choose a local GGUF model. LDA will not check it." = "請選擇本機 GGUF 模型。LDA 不會對它進行驗證。";

/* Model setup: the first-run ask, the pre-scan gate, the export gate, and the advisories (2026-09-03). */
"Download the Model (%@)" = "下載模型（%@）";
"I Already Have the File…" = "匯入已有的模型檔案…";
"This Mac cannot run a detection model" = "本機無法執行偵測模型";
"This Mac does not have the memory to run a detection model, so LDA does not offer one here. Scans on this Mac match patterns only, and names and company names stay in the document. Adding a model file by hand would not change that." = "本機記憶體不足，無法執行偵測模型，故不提供。掃描僅按規則比對，自然人姓名與單位名稱將留存於文件；手動匯入模型檔案亦不能改變。";
"Scan without a detection model?" = "要在沒有偵測模型的情況下掃描嗎？";
"This scan will not look for people's names or company names, and it matches an address only in the Chinese street form, stopping at the street number. Those values stay in the document and are not in the review list. Emails, phones, dates, amounts, ID numbers, case numbers, bank accounts, license plates, WeChat IDs, links, and seals are still found." = "本次掃描不會尋找人名或公司名稱，地址也只有中文街道格式才比對得到，且只比對到門牌號為止。這些內容會留在文件裡，而且不會出現在待檢閱清單中。電子郵件、電話、日期、金額、身分證號、案號、銀行帳號、車牌號、微信 ID、網址和印章仍會被找出。";
"Scan Without Names" = "不找人名，直接掃描";
"No detection model is installed, so this scan will not look for people's names or company names, and it matches an address only in the Chinese street form. It still finds emails, phones, dates, amounts, ID numbers, and case numbers. Add a model to find names." = "尚未安裝偵測模型，因此本次掃描不會尋找人名或公司名稱，地址也只有中文街道格式才比對得到。它仍會找出電子郵件、電話、日期、金額、身分證號和案號。新增模型即可找出人名。";
"The model for the detection level you chose is not installed, so this scan will not look for people's names or company names, and it matches an address only in the Chinese street form. It still finds emails, phones, dates, amounts, ID numbers, and case numbers. Add that model, or choose an installed level in Settings." = "你所選偵測層級對應的模型尚未安裝，因此本次掃描不會尋找人名或公司名稱，地址也只有中文街道格式才比對得到。它仍會找出電子郵件、電話、日期、金額、身分證號和案號。請新增該模型，或在「設定」中改選一個已安裝的層級。";
"Patterns only is selected and no detection model is installed, so no scan on this Mac looks for people's names or company names. Those names stay in the document. Add a model, then choose a detection level in Settings." = "目前選擇的是「僅使用規則」，且本機未安裝偵測模型，因此這台 Mac 上的任何掃描都不會尋找人名或公司名稱。這些名稱會留在文件裡。請新增模型，然後在「設定」中選擇偵測層級。";
"This Mac does not have the memory to run a detection model, so scans here match patterns only. People's names and company names stay in the document." = "這台 Mac 的記憶體不足以執行偵測模型，因此這裡的掃描只能比對規則。人名和公司名稱會留在文件裡。";
"Document ready. Click Scan for PII to spot dates, amounts, emails, phones, and ID numbers. Names and company names need a detection model." = "文件已準備完成。點選「掃描個人識別資訊」以偵測日期、金額、電子郵件、電話和身分證號。人名和公司名稱需要偵測模型。";
"Spot PII in the open document: dates, amounts, emails, phones, ID numbers (Cmd+Shift+S). People's names and company names need a detection model." = "在開啟的文件中找出個人識別資訊：日期、金額、電子郵件、電話、身分證號（Cmd+Shift+S）。人名和公司名稱需要偵測模型。";
"Drop Word, PDF, or text files (or a .zip). The app scans each one and you review what it will protect. Which kinds of value it can find depends on the detection model above." = "拖入 Word、PDF 或文字檔案（或 .zip）。App 會逐一掃描，再由你檢閱要保護的內容。能找出哪些類型，取決於上方的偵測模型。";
"Export a copy where the AI pass did not run?" = "要匯出 AI 未執行過的副本嗎？";
"The AI pass did not run on at least one of these documents, so people's names and company names were not looked for there and are still in the copy you are about to write. Read that copy before you hand it to an AI tool, or add a detection model and scan those documents again." = "這些文件中至少有一份沒有執行 AI，因此其中的人名和公司名稱未被尋找，仍然留在你即將寫出的副本裡。把副本交給 AI 工具之前請先通讀，或者新增偵測模型並重新掃描這些文件。";
"Export Anyway" = "仍要匯出";
"No detection model is installed for the selected detection level, so people's names and company names were not looked for, and an address was matched only in the Chinese street form. Choose a different level in Settings, or add the model file." = "所選偵測層級沒有安裝偵測模型，因此沒有尋找人名和公司名稱，地址也只按中文街道格式比對。請在「設定」中改選層級，或新增模型檔案。";

/* Export gate: the partial-coverage body, kept apart from the one for a pass that never ran (2026-09-03). */
"Export a copy where the AI pass did not finish?" = "要匯出 AI 未掃描完的副本嗎？";
"The AI pass started on at least one of these documents and did not cover all of it, so some people's names and company names were found there and others were not. A review list can look complete and still be short of what the text holds. Read the copy you are about to write before you hand it to an AI tool, or scan those documents again." = "這些文件中至少有一份的 AI 掃描沒有涵蓋全文：其中一些人名和公司名稱被找了出來，另一些沒有。待檢閱清單看起來完整，仍可能少於文件中實際存在的內容。請在把即將寫出的副本交給 AI 工具之前先通讀它，或者重新掃描這些文件。";

// MARK: - Wizard language steps (2026-09-03)
"Step %lld of %lld" = "第 %lld 步，共 %lld 步";
"Choose a detection model" = "選擇偵測模型";
"Only a detection model finds the names of people and organisations. Without one, those names stay in the document, they are not in the review list, and the copy you hand to an AI tool still identifies your client." = "自然人姓名與單位名稱須由偵測模型辨識；未安裝模型者，該類資訊留存於文件、不進入待檢閱清單，交付 AI 工具的副本仍可辨識委任人。";
"Recommended" = "推薦";
"Recommended: it fits this Mac with room to spare and leaves the least to dismiss." = "推薦：本機記憶體充裕，且須人工排除者最少。";
"Recommended because offline mode is on." = "離線模式已開啟，推薦此項。";
"Runs on every Mac LDA supports. About one flag in five is one you will dismiss." = "LDA 支援的所有 Mac 均可執行；約每五處標記有一處須排除。";
"Misses as little as Quick, with a third as much to dismiss." = "漏檢與「快速」相當，須排除者約為其三分之一。";
"Missed nothing in testing, including the Chinese bank branch name Balanced missed. About twice the wait of Balanced." = "測試中並無漏檢，含「標準」漏檢的中文銀行分行名稱；耗時約為「標準」兩倍。";
"No model runs. The names of people and organisations are not detected." = "不執行模型；自然人姓名與單位名稱不予偵測。";
"This Mac has %lld GB of memory, so %@ cannot run here." = "本機記憶體 %lld GB，%@ 無法執行。";
"Download and Use" = "下載並啟用";
"Downloading connects to %@. If that is unreachable, add a file you got on another Mac." = "下載將連線 %@；無法存取的，可匯入在另一台 Mac 上取得的檔案。";
"Offline mode is on, so downloads are off. You can still add a file you got on another Mac." = "離線模式已開啟，不提供下載；可匯入在另一台 Mac 上取得的檔案。";
"No model runs. In our own test on two agreements, a scan with no model missed 32 of the 36 names, organisations, and addresses. Fixed formats are still found, and LDA asks again before the first scan of each document." = "不執行模型。經我方測試，未裝模型的掃描在 36 項姓名、名稱與地址中漏檢 32 項；固定格式資訊仍予檢出，首次掃描前會再次提示。";
"Downloading the detection model." = "正在下載偵測模型。";
"Installed and in use. Scans will now find the names of people and organisations." = "已安裝並啟用；此後掃描將偵測自然人姓名與單位名稱。";
"LDA protects client information before it reaches an AI tool, and puts it back afterwards." = "LDA 在文件交付 AI 工具之前對委任人資訊脫敏，事後再行還原。";
"Re-scan" = "重新掃描";
"matter" = "該事項";
